---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Us | We Are Here to Point You to Jesus"
  description="At CSASHOPONLINE, we believe that what saves a soul is knowing Jesus personally. Learn how the Divine Blueprint Series by Christine A. makes the Old Testament come alive."
>
  <!-- [Hero Section] -->
  <section class="bg-[#0A1128] text-white py-24 md:py-32 px-6 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-block font-montserrat text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37] bg-[#D4AF37]/10 border border-[#D4AF37]/30 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6">
        Our Story &amp; Mission
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-playfair text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-8 leading-tight">
        We Are Here to Point You to <span class="text-[#D4AF37]">Jesus.</span>
      </h1>
      <div class="font-inter text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-200 space-y-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          At CSASHOPONLINE, we believe that Christianity is not just about going to church on Sunday. It is not about being a good person or following a list of rules.
        </p>
        <p class="font-playfair italic text-2xl md:text-3xl text-[#D4AF37] font-semibold">
          What saves a soul is knowing Jesus personally.
        </p>
        <p>
          And we know Jesus through His Word and by His Spirit.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-base md:text-lg">
          But we also know that reading the Bible can be hard. The Old Testament can feel intimidating, confusing, and even boring. That is why we exist. We exist to make the Bible come alive. We exist to show you that every single page of scripture - from Genesis to Malachi - is pointing to one person: <strong>Jesus</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- [Section 2: Our Mission & Goals] -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="font-playfair text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] mb-6">
        The Divine Blueprint Series: One Message, Three Audiences.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-inter text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        We noticed that most Christian books overwhelm their readers. A 7-year-old child is handed the same book as a 45-year-old skeptic. That is not how people learn. So, we built a system that respects the reader. We took the same core message - <strong>Finding Jesus in the Old Testament</strong> - and we tailored it for three unique learning styles:
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-t-4 border-[#D4AF37]">
        <span class="font-montserrat text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#D4AF37] block mb-2">Path 01</span>
        <h3 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] mb-3">1. For the Seeker</h3>
        <p class="font-inter text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Deep, investigative, and full of ancient mystery and evidence. We want to engage the intellectual mind and answer honest skepticism with real proof.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-t-4 border-[#6B8E7B]">
        <span class="font-montserrat text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6B8E7B] block mb-2">Path 02</span>
        <h3 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] mb-3">2. For the New Believer</h3>
        <p class="font-inter text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Simple, warm, and full of grace. We want to build a strong foundation and unshakeable confidence in the Bible without confusing Christian jargon.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-t-4 border-[#4A90E2]">
        <span class="font-montserrat text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#4A90E2] block mb-2">Path 03</span>
        <h3 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] mb-3">3. For the Child (Ages 4-8)</h3>
        <p class="font-inter text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Clean, fun, and highly interactive. We want to plant the seeds of faith early, without distracting worldly characters, using coloring pages, activities, and simple prayers to build strong character and biblical morals.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-[#0A1128] text-white p-8 rounded-2xl text-center">
      <p class="font-playfair italic text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#D4AF37]">
        "Our ultimate goal is not to sell books. It is to point you to a deeper, more personal relationship with the One who saved you."
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- [Section 3: Why Trust Us?] -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-white border-y border-gray-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <span class="font-montserrat text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#6C757D] block mb-3">
        Rooted in Scripture
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-playfair text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] mb-6">
        We Do the Research. You Reap the Reward.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-inter text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        We are not here to sell you fluff. Every book in the Divine Blueprint Series is rigorously grounded in Scripture. We study the original languages, the ancient Hebrew festivals, the historical context, and the messianic prophecies, and we distill them into easy-to-read, 30-day journeys.
      </p>
      <p class="font-inter text-lg text-[#0A1128] font-semibold leading-relaxed">
        Whether you are reading as a skeptic, a saint, or a seven-year-old, you can trust that the content is pure, biblically accurate, and designed to draw you closer to Jesus.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- [Section 4: Final Call to Action] -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="font-playfair text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] mb-6">
      Ready to Discover the Truth?
    </h2>
    <p class="font-inter text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-10">
      You do not have to stay confused by the Old Testament. You do not have to abandon reading. Start your 30-day journey today and discover the hidden Jesus on every page.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/#choose-your-journey"
        class="min-h-[48px] inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#D4AF37] text-[#0A1128] px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-montserrat font-bold hover:bg-[#0A1128] hover:text-white transition-colors"
      >
        Choose Your Journey
      </a>
      <a
        href="/shop/"
        class="min-h-[48px] inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#0A1128] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-montserrat font-bold hover:bg-[#D4AF37] hover:text-[#0A1128] transition-colors"
      >
        Shop All Books
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>